 up with Salesforce – the 4th largest software company in the world. We use their infrastructure to deliver a solution that is low cost, high powered, and universally flexible. The low-code, drag-and-drop functionality empowers you to integrate any number of apps to suit your business now and as you open new lines of business in years to come. Born on the Cloud and Built for Insurance Truly cloud-native, Novidea’s insurance management platform allows you to securely access customer data from anywhere on any device. As you scale your business, you can count on peak performance without managing servers, updating software or worrying about backups. Actionable Intelligence for Smart Business Growth Novidea leverages Big Technology to give you actionable intelligence and insights at the point of need. This empowers you to make better-informed decisions that grow your business and deliver greater customer value. Compete and Succeed in the Modern World with Novidea One platform to manage your entire distribution lifecycle All your data and insights accessible from any device, anywhere, any time Seamless upgrades, no hardware costs or proprietary supplier code Open API architecture for assembling your ideal solution World-class security and compliance across international markets Book a Meeting Novidea is the creator of the first born-in-the-cloud, data-driven insurance platform that enables brokers, agents and MGAs to manage the customer insurance journey end-to-end and drive growth across the entire insurance distribution lifecycle. Platform Solutions Partners About Us Customer Support Careers Blog Resources Contact Us LinekdIn Instagram Facebook YouTube Subscribe to our BLOG > USA website © 2026 Novidea. All Rights Reserved. Privacy Policy | Terms of use Anti Slavery | Cookie Policy",
