      "description": "Insurance Analytics and Reporting Software | Novidea Skip to content Platform Platform Overview Big Technology Workflows and Automation Actionable Intelligence Front Office Middle Office Back Office Integrations Document Generation Customer Portals Security Solutions London Market MGAs Brokers Hybrid Fronting Carriers Coverholders Lines of Business Partners Resources About Us Company Leadership News Awards Careers Blog Contact Us Customer Support | Careers | Blog | Resources | Contact Us Book a Meeting Open Navigation Menu Insurance Analytics: Turn Data into Smart Decisions Decipher your data. Use actionable intelligence to make smarter decisions that drive growth and build customer loyalty. Book a Meeting Visibility of your data across your business By bringing every aspect of your business into a single cloud-based platform, Novidea enables your people—from brokers and salespeople, to the C-suite—to leverage actionable intelligence and drive greater insight across your business. With a fully integrated system and 360-degree visibility for your front , middle , and back office, you and your teams can make more timely, better-informed decisions that lead to new opportunities. Build relationships through- data-driven insight Our powerful analytics tools generate data-driven insights that enable you to provide a more personalised experience at every stage of the insurance distribution lifecycle, from policy coverage recommendations to risk management advice. This helps you foster new business leads and increase customer retention. Report on anything from anywhere In addition to offering pre-built report templates, Novidea allows you to quickly and easily create custom reports from any data field across the entire platform. This empowers you to examine your business from any angle at any time to understand how you can reduce operational inefficiencies and see where you should be focusing your efforts to maximise your future opportunities. Tailor dashboards to each role Using our customisable dashboards, you can create job-specific infographics that present the data you need any way you need it, whether it’s a business-wide overview or something drilled down to a granular level. Your CEO can instantly view and examine current retention rates or new policies sold each month, while your brokers and agents can quickly review their sales and commissions to date. Each dashboard can be permission based, so you choose who has access to what information. Deliver a more personalised experience By providing truly data-driven and actionable insights, Novidea empowers your team to excel at the aspects of insurance that will always require a human touch, like explaining complex coverage options, offering guidance on tough choices, providing confidence and reassurance, and being there as a valued partner and resource whenever customers need it. By helping you turn data into decisions, we help you turn every customer touch point into a chance to build a lasting relationship. Novidea is the creator of the first born-in-the-cloud, data-driven insurance platform that enables brokers, agents and MGAs to manage the customer insurance journey end-to-end and drive growth across the entire insurance distribution lifecycle. Platform Solutions Partners About Us Customer Support Careers Blog Resources Contact Us LinekdIn Instagram Facebook YouTube Subscribe to our BLOG > USA website © 2026 Novidea. All Rights Reserved. Privacy Policy | Terms of use Anti Slavery | Cookie Policy",
