      "description": "Insurance Document Generation Software | Novidea Skip to content Platform Platform Overview Big Technology Workflows and Automation Actionable Intelligence Front Office Middle Office Back Office Integrations Document Generation Customer Portals Security Solutions London Market MGAs Brokers Hybrid Fronting Carriers Coverholders Lines of Business Partners Resources About Us Company Leadership News Awards Careers Blog Contact Us Customer Support | Careers | Blog | Resources | Contact Us Book a Meeting Open Navigation Menu Insurance Document Generation That Turns Complexity into a Competitive Advantage Enhance your insurance processes with accurate, compliant documents—policies, quotes, MRCs, coverslips, and binding documents—generated directly from your CRM Book A Meeting Streamlined Insurance Document Management Novidea’s document generation tool (Docomotion) eliminates manual document creation, saving time and reducing errors. By using real-time data integration and intelligent templates, you can quickly generate accurate, compliant insurance documents that align with business rules and regulatory standards. With seamless access to the latest customer data and policy details, documents are always up-to-date, consistent, and ready for use—so there is no more rekeying or inconsistencies—just accurate, compliant documents every time. Download the brochure Work Smarter with Familiar Tools Keep your brokers working in the environment they know well by integrating your document templates with Microsoft Word and your CRM. The add-on syncs data in real time, allowing you to create, edit, and manage documents throughout the insurance lifecycle—from customer enquiries and RFQs, to proposals and renewals—without leaving Word. Docomotion is a company that really understands the pain points of the insurance industry, offering a document generation solution that makes our job much easier. Complicated document requirements have become simple to achieve, thanks to Docomotion. In some areas we’ve managed to reduce the number of templates from 150 to only 20 “smart” templates, which has been a real game changer Raj Sakaria, Director of enterprise architecture and apps London Market Compliance Made Easy Meet Lloyd’s Blueprint Two (MRC & CDR) requirements effortlessly by digitising and streamlining the creation of key insurance documents. These include MRCs, quotes, coverslips, and declarations, as well as the integration of standard London Market wordings and clauses. Effortless Template Design Create and edit sophisticated, uniform templates for policies, quotes, and binding documents with our user-friendly Microsoft Word-based editor. No coding required—just drag and drop reusable components, including policy subforms and market-specific logic rules, for consistent, professional documents. Docomotion Connect: Perfect Documents from Any Platform Docomotion Connect enables real-time document generation from any platform via lightweight REST APIs. You can integrate with any core system — not just your CRM — and centralise document creation across teams and tools. It ensures brand and regulatory consistency at scale, while reducing processing times by up to 90%. Built for speed, security and flexibility, it’s ideal for enterprises looking to automate document workflows end to end, without disrupting how teams already work. Download brochure Ready to see it in action? Contact us to learn more. Novidea is the creator of the first born-in-the-cloud, data-driven insurance platform that enables brokers, agents and MGAs to manage the customer insurance journey end-to-end and drive growth across the entire insurance distribution lifecycle. Platform Solutions Partners About Us Customer Support Careers Blog Resources Contact Us LinekdIn Instagram Facebook YouTube Subscribe to our BLOG > USA website © 2026 Novidea. All Rights Reserved. Privacy Policy | Terms of use Anti Slavery | Cookie Policy",
