ncluding the customer portal. This ensures zero data lag for customers, so they see the same live information as your team from the moment it is entered. In addition, when customers make or request changes to their accounts through the portal, your team is instantly notified and can respond accordingly. Generate inbound and cross- selling opportunities Novidea’s portal can also be used to present customers with information such as articles, videos, white papers, and other marketing materials. You can then easily track user activity and create dialogue between customers and brokers. This uncovers their areas of interest, so that your team can grow the account through cross-selling and up-selling opportunities. Novidea is the creator of the first born-in-the-cloud, data-driven insurance platform that enables brokers, agents and MGAs to manage the customer insurance journey end-to-end and drive growth across the entire insurance distribution lifecycle. Platform Solutions Partners About Us Customer Support Careers Blog Resources Contact Us LinekdIn Instagram Facebook YouTube Subscribe to our BLOG > USA website © 2026 Novidea. All Rights Reserved. Privacy Policy | Terms of use Anti Slavery | Cookie Policy",
