 Salesforce also offers robust user privilege options to help better control and increase security within your organisation. Salesforce also offers real-time monitoring and user-friendly tools to help protect your critical information. They build security into everything they do, and offer resources and tools to help organisations stay as safe as possible. Give your customers peace of mind knowing their data is protected by the unparalleled power of Salesforce. LIMIT YOUR EXPOSURE TO DANGEROUS CYBER ATTACKS Cyber attacks can be devastating. A single breach can cost millions and ruin your reputation. Novidea drastically reduces that risk with constantly-updated security measures. Rest easy knowing your organisation and customers are protected by the industry’s most secure platform. WORK WITH A PARTNER YOU CAN TRUST While some management and distribution systems have two or three security and compliance certifications, Novidea boasts dozens. All to ensure that, no matter what type of insurance you write, we have the measures in place to keep you secure at all times and on every device. STAY COMPLIANT WITH THE LATEST RULES AND REGULATIONS Novidea’s platform is designed to make sure all customer data is stored and managed in compliance with the latest rules and regulations, even as they continue to evolve. Salesforce maintains over 50 compliance certifications to ensure no matter what type of data you handle you can rest assured they have the compliance covered. Novidea is the creator of the first born-in-the-cloud, data-driven insurance platform that enables brokers, agents and MGAs to manage the customer insurance journey end-to-end and drive growth across the entire insurance distribution lifecycle. Platform Solutions Partners About Us Customer Support Careers Blog Resources Contact Us LinekdIn Instagram Facebook YouTube Subscribe to our BLOG > USA website © 2026 Novidea. All Rights Reserved. Privacy Policy | Terms of use Anti Slavery | Cookie Policy",
