      "location": "United States",
      "url": "https://novidea.com/career/06dcf642-d78b-45e5-a024-9477daabdcde",
      "description": "Job Vacancy | Novidea Skip to content Platform Platform Overview Big Technology Workflows and Automation Actionable Intelligence Front Office Middle Office Back Office Integrations Document Generation Customer Portals Security Solutions London Market MGAs Brokers Hybrid Fronting Carriers Coverholders Lines of Business Partners Resources About Us Company Leadership News Awards Careers Blog Contact Us Customer Support | Careers | Blog | Resources | Contact Us Book a Meeting Open Navigation Menu Career Regional Growth Marketing Manager United States · FullTime Join Us. Make Your Imprint. Novidea is an insurance technology company solving the toughest challenges faced by insurance brokers, agencies, MGAs and coverholders. Our innovative, data-driven insurance software platform allows users to manage the entire policy lifecycle across all lines of business, using data to inform every business decision, cross-sell and up-sell. What’s the job We are looking for a Regional Growth Marketing Manager to drive pipeline growth, market expansion, and strategic account engagement across North America and APAC. Based on the East Coast and reporting to the Vice President of Marketing, this role will execute regional go-to-market programs designed to generate pipeline, accelerate opportunities, strengthen brand presence, and support enterprise sales growth within local markets. This role partners closely with Sales Leadership, SDRs, Product Marketing, and Global Marketing teams to deliver impactful campaigns, field marketing initiatives, account-based marketing programs, and regional growth activities aligned with business objectives and revenue targets. The role covers North America (United States and Canada), APAC, and additional Rest of World territories as assigned. Some travel may be required from time to time to support regional activities. What You’ll Do Own and execute regional marketing programs designed to generate pipeline, accelerate opportunities, and support strategic revenue growth. Execute localized marketing campaigns across digital, social media, PR, and industry channels. Build and strengthen Novidea’s market presence and profile across regional insurance and Insurtech communities. Own regional marketing contribution targets through focused demand generation and account engagement initiatives. Partner closely with Sales Leadership and SDR teams to align marketing activity with strategic target accounts, pipeline priorities, and regional growth plans. Collaborate with Global Marketing and Product Marketing teams to localize messaging, campaigns, product positioning, and content for regional markets. Track and report on campaign performance, pipeline contribution, conversion metrics, and event ROI, providing recommendations for continuous optimization. Support customer advocacy, reference programs, and strategic customer engagement initiatives within the region. Execute account-based marketing (ABM) and intent-led marketing programs aligned to enterprise sales motions. Build relationships with key industry associations, partners, media contacts, and event organizations across the insurance market. Maintain strong alignment with global brand standards and go-to-market priorities. What You Bring 3+ years of experience in B2B marketing, field marketing, growth marketing, or regional marketing roles within SaaS, technology, or Insurtech environments. Experience executing integrated marketing campaigns across digital, field, and account-based marketing channels. Experience supporting enterprise or complex B2B sales environments. Strong understanding of pipeline generation, marketing attribution, and campaign ROI measurement. Ability to engage confidently with senior commercial stakeholders and external industry audiences. Experience working within fast-growth or scale-up organizations is highly advantageous. Experience within SaaS, technology, and/or Insurtech organizations is strongly preferred. The Novidean Way We Originate | We Collaborate | We Step Up | We Evolve | We Make an Imprint We hire people, not just skills. We encourage you to apply if you think this role is a great fit for you, even if you don’t meet 100% of the requirements. Novidea is an equal-opportunity employer. We believe that diversity is integral to our success, and we are proud of and committed to providing equal opportunity employment to all individuals regardless of race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, citizenship, national origin, disability, Veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by law. #remote Novidea is the creator of the first born-in-the-cloud, data-driven insurance platform that enables brokers, agents and MGAs to manage the customer insurance journey end-to-end and drive growth across the entire insurance distribution lifecycle. Platform Solutions Partners About Us Customer Support Careers Blog Resources Contact Us LinekdIn Instagram Facebook YouTube Subscribe to our BLOG > USA website © 2026 Novidea. All Rights Reserved. Privacy Policy | Terms of use Anti Slavery | Cookie Policy",
