      "url": "https://novidea.com/company/",
      "description": "About Novidea, the Insurance Management Platform Company Skip to content Platform Platform Overview Big Technology Workflows and Automation Actionable Intelligence Front Office Middle Office Back Office Integrations Document Generation Customer Portals Security Solutions London Market MGAs Brokers Hybrid Fronting Carriers Coverholders Lines of Business Partners Resources About Us Company Leadership News Awards Careers Blog Contact Us Customer Support | Careers | Blog | Resources | Contact Us Book a Meeting Open Navigation Menu Premium insurtech. Powerful knowledge. Dedicated experts. Empower your people with Novidea’s cloud-native, AI-ready data-driven insurance management system for brokers, MGAs, and hybrid fronting carriers to modernise and manage the customer journey end-to-end and drive growth across the entire insurance distribution lifecycle. Contact Us OUR TECH Our insurance distribution platform is built to digitalise insurance businesses. That means fuelling rapid growth, optimising customer experience, gleaning real-time insights and actionable intelligence, and more. Novidea leverages the power of Salesforce’s Big Technology . It provides a complete ecosystem spanning every aspect of an insurance business. This enables full integration between customer-facing policy transactions and the middle and back office. Meanwhile, Novidea gathers customer data, turning it into actionable insights for delivering greater customer value through tailored products and services. All this happens in one platform that you can access anytime from anywhere. YOUR DATA The better you know your customers, the better you can anticipate their insurance needs. Sadly, most brokers are sitting on a treasure trove of customer data that they never turn into actionable insights. Novidea capitalises on customer information like never before, turning it into insights that allow you to create a superior customer experience across all channels. OUR TEAM Digitalising a company doesn’t happen overnight. It requires a true partnership. To foster that type of relationship, we follow through on our core values: WE INSPIRE AND LEAD SUCCESS By demonstrating thought leadership and paving the way for digital transformation in the insurance industry. WE EMPOWER COLLEAGUES AND CUSTOMERS By providing experienced guidance, steadfast support, and premium solutions. We Constantly Innovate By building new and effective solutions and creating synergies. We Instill Confidence By being committed, by holding ourselves accountable, and by truly caring. TOP BROKERS, AGENTS, AND ENTERPRISES RUN ON NOVIDEA We support insurance industry leaders across the globe. We’d love to talk to you about how we can help you and your business. Contact us . Novidea is the creator of the first born-in-the-cloud, data-driven insurance platform that enables brokers, agents and MGAs to manage the customer insurance journey end-to-end and drive growth across the entire insurance distribution lifecycle. Platform Solutions Partners About Us Customer Support Careers Blog Resources Contact Us LinekdIn Instagram Facebook YouTube Subscribe to our BLOG > USA website © 2026 Novidea. All Rights Reserved. Privacy Policy | Terms of use Anti Slavery | Cookie Policy",
